    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_0fcecde8",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts a man in a wrecked car, raising his hand in a gesture of positivity or optimism while others around him appear to be helping or reacting to the wreckage. The text overlay reads 'when everything is going wrong but you're positive,' which juxtaposes the chaotic, destructive visual with a message of optimism. The overall intent is to humorously or ironically highlight the contrast between dire circumstances and maintaining a positive attitude. There is no evidence of toxicity, hate, abuse, cyberbullying, misogyny, ableism, or other harmful content. The meme is intended to be a lighthearted commentary on resilience or optimism in adversity, not to target or demean any specific group or individual.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_76091b32"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
