      "label": "Positive Attitude in Adversity Meme Concept",
      "description": "The target audience is individuals familiar with internet meme culture and motivational discourse, who understand the irony or humor in juxtaposing extreme adversity with a message of optimism. This includes users of social media platforms where such memes circulate, particularly those who appreciate self-deprecating or absurdist humor about resilience.",
